{"id":"cff47baaf3aae6af","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-boolean-sensitivity.md","title":"Boolean Sensitivity","display":"df-boolean-sensitivity — Boolean Sensitivity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-boolean-sensitivity","aliases":["28-df-boolean-sensitivity"],"display":"df-boolean-sensitivity — Boolean Sensitivity","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 12.10","source_printed_pages":"266","source_pdf_pages":"292","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-boolean-sensitivity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-boolean-sensitivity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-sensitivity — Boolean Sensitivity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 12.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"266"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"292"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^{\\oplus S}\">\\(x^{\\oplus S}\\)</span> 表示在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S\\subseteq[n]\\)</span> 中翻转x的坐标，以下给出逐坐标定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(x^{\\oplus S})_j\\coloneqq x_j\\oplus\\mathbf1[j\\in S]\\quad(j\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(x^{\\oplus S})_j\\coloneqq x_j\\oplus\\mathbf1[j\\in S]\\quad(j\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s_x(f)\\coloneqq|\\{i\\in[n]:f(x)\\ne f(x^{\\oplus\\{i\\}})\\}|,\\qquad s(f)\\coloneqq\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}s_x(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s_x(f)\\coloneqq|\\{i\\in[n]:f(x)\\ne f(x^{\\oplus\\{i\\}})\\}|,\\qquad s(f)\\coloneqq\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}s_x(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限集合保证计数与最大值良定义；常函数和n=0给零敏感度。保留固定输入与全局最坏输入两个层次，为块敏感度和证书界提供精确接口。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 12.10；印刷页 266；PDF 页 292。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第12章的 Boolean Sensitivity，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"x^{\\oplus S}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"(x^{\\oplus S})_j\\coloneqq x_j\\oplus\\mathbf1[j\\in S]\\quad(j\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"s_x(f)\\coloneqq|\\{i\\in[n]:f(x)\\ne f(x^{\\oplus\\{i\\}})\\}|,\\qquad s(f)\\coloneqq\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}s_x(f).","display":true}],"bytes":1497,"backlinks":[{"id":"aa724d0d8b6348dc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$，$b\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}$；$x^{\\oplus S}$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]。"},{"id":"bbc032dc63b4bea2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$s(f),bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]；$D_{\\mathrm{DT}}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-decision-tree]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-333","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-zero-error-query-complexity]]、[[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]、[[28-lem-sensitivity-query-bounds]]、[[28-thm-sensitivity-certificate-bound]]、[[28-df-multilinear-degree]]、[[28-lem-degree-query-lower-bound]]、[[28-thm-query-degree-upper-bounds]]。"},{"id":"12ca2ea9396c7639","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$C(f)$ 见 [[28-df-certificate-complexity]]；$s(f),bs(f)$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-sensitivity]]、[[28-df-block-sensitivity]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}